  "description": "First love for the people. '\n\nBeloved actor Joo Ye-il.\n\nAnd,\n\n“I, I’ll make you a pack.“\n\nHer sponsor. Enter's planning director and the sole successor to Daehan Group. Kang Do-hoon.\n\nFour years of close relationship.\n\n“Let’s stop. We're not in such a squishy relationship when we finish it, are we?'\n\nAfter a sudden breakup notice, Yale, a strong candidate for the Best Actress award that year, suddenly goes into hiding. Yale, who left for a place where Dohun could not find, is not aware of the news for five years.\n\n\"You're your child?\"  \n  “…….”  \n“The child looks a lot like me. Yale.“\n\nFive years later, she came to Korea, and she happens to reunite with him with a child who resembles Dohun.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9567552)\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=4940356), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8605375)\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003089)",
